  <bioghist id="915d3ff529696848df687b0c1de792de">
    <head>Biographical / Historical</head>
<p>Mary Loftus served as the Manager of Information Dissemination and Administration in the Office of Communications at the Ford Foundation.</p>  </bioghist>
